      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: 666_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme uses a Black man's image juxtaposed with the false scientific claim that '666 is the chemical make up of black people,' which is a racist and scientifically baseless assertion. This is a direct attack on Black people based on race, using pseudo-science to dehumanize and demean them. The text 'not any beast... unlearn their bullshit!' reinforces the hateful intent by invoking degrading stereotypes and inciting hostility toward the Black community. The overall intent is to spread hate and reinforce harmful racial stereotypes through a visually provocative and intentionally offensive analogy.",
