      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the Black man in the image as the target of the racist pseudoscientific claim",
      "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the Black man depicted in the visual material, who is being targeted by the hateful textual claim that '666 is the chemical make up of black people.' The phrase 'unlearn their bullshit!' further implies the user is being called upon to reject the racist ideology being projected onto the man. The visual material (the Black man) is the direct target of the dehumanizing message, and the user is positioned as the one who must 'unlearn' the falsehoods, making the man the focal point of the projection.",
