      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed to target and incite hostility toward the Black community by using racist pseudoscience and dehumanizing stereotypes. The visual of a Black man and the text '666 is the chemical make up of black people' are explicitly aimed at provoking racial hatred and reinforcing harmful anti-Black tropes such as comparing Black people to beasts or primates. The phrase 'unlearn their bullshit!' is a direct call to action that targets those who may be exposed to or sympathetic to racist ideologies, encouraging them to reject or 'unlearn' the perceived falsehoods about Black people. The meme relies on the audience's understanding of racial stereotypes and the historical context of racial pseudoscience to be effective, making its target community those who are either already harboring racist beliefs or are susceptible to such hateful messaging.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_457ca431"
